WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
A male stickleback grows a red
belly and swims a zigzag dance.

2
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.800
Red deer stags roar and fight.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.250
Birds sing.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.710
All of it costs energy and
time, and fighting risks injury.

5
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.290
So why would an animal
spend energy singing,

6
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.980
displaying or fighting,
instead of just feeding?

7
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:24.270
In this mission, you'll find out what
courtship signals tell a partner.

8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.290
Then you'll test an idea
with a real experiment,

9
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.850
where green light hides the
stickleback's red belly.

10
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.800
Your mission: explain why an
animal would spend energy singing,

11
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:38.030
displaying or fighting
instead of just feeding.
